"Choose your car in Setup to see it in 3D.": "Elige tu coche en Configuración para verlo en 3D.",
"Choose your car in Setup → <strong>Car</strong>. It lists the cars you've driven, and picks the one you're in while iRacing is running. Not listed? <em>Choose its folder…</em> and pick the car's folder in Documents\\iRacing\\paint.": "Elige tu coche en Setup → <strong>Coche</strong>. Muestra los coches que has conducido y elige el que llevas mientras iRacing está abierto. ¿No está? Usa <em>Elige su carpeta…</em> y elige la carpeta del coche en Documents\\iRacing\\paint.",
